#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "570856"
msgid "After making a shortcut to the old school from\nthe #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF, please return to base."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "570960"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF, you appear to have accumulated\na lot of fatigue. I recommend that\nyou return for the moment to take a rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "571096"
msgid "I'm concerned about #C236196003Rin#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "571140"
msgid "Searching the Labyrinth is nice and all,\nbut I should #C000246204return to the old school#CDEF to\nbriefly speak with #C236196003Kiara#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "571280"
msgid "I obtained the first #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nLet's briefly return to #C000246204My Room#CDEF and sort\nout the situation."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "571400"
msgid "First thing to do is activate the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF.\nThat'll help move our search along."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "571500"
msgid "We took more damage from our fight with #C236196003Lancer#CDEF\nthan I expected. Now would be a good time to head\nback to the old school.\nLuckily, there's a #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF near us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "571692"
msgid "What's wrong, Praetor?\nLet's #C000246204continue onward#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "571756"
msgid "Don't worry. I'll protect you, Darling.\nSo, continue on #C000246204ahead#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "571836"
msgid "Surely you're not telling me that you're\nfrightened? Even you understand that stopping\nhere is impermissible, yes?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "571952"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF. After you activate the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF,\nplease have yourself a rest in your\nprivate room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "572080"
msgid "Even in cyberspace, you need proper rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "572124"
msgid "Once you activate the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF,\nuse it to get back here.\nI'll bet you're exhausted, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "572252"
msgid "#[Mr.][Ms.]##C236196003 #NICK#CDEF, return to base for now.\nLet's discuss our plan\nin the #C000246204Student Council Room#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "572380"
msgid "#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF, please come back.\nYou've accumulated a lot of fatigue;\nany more will be dangerous!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "572488"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF's worried state gets across to\nme even over the transmission."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "572576"
msgid "She's right, it would be best if\nwe returned to the #C000246204Old School Building#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "572668"
msgid "We obtained the #C000246204SG#CDEF. Let's return to the\n#C000246204Old School Building#CDEF for the time being.\nWe can come again after we recover."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "572816"
msgid "We got the #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nMission complete.\nLet's head home and get some rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "572900"
msgid "Where are you going? We secured the #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nThere's nothing urgent to tend to.\nBack to #C000246204My Room#CDEF, now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "573032"
msgid "Hrrrm? Where are you going, #C236196003#FAMILY\n#GIVEN#CDEF? Where are you going,\nleaving me behind?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "573132"
msgid "For a second there, I was thinking about\nleaving #C236196003Gatou#CDEF and heading back,\nbut it probably won't rest easy on my conscience,\nso let's turn back."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "573292"
msgid "Wait, Praetor. If we're going to head back,\nit'll behoove us for the future to have\nthe #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF activated."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "573420"
msgid "Master, let's look for the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF.\nIt should be around here somewhere…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "573512"
msgid "We don't need to walk all the way back.\nWe can use the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF to reach the\nold school in a flash. Very nifty."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "573644"
msgid "M-my stomach is at its limit…\nI want to hurry back to #C000246204My Room#CDEF and get some rest…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "573744"
msgid "Before we go to the next floor,\nlet's #C000246204head back to the Student Council Room#CDEF.\nWe need to hand over the data we got from #C236196003Green Archer#CDEF.\nHe gave his life to entrust us with it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "573952"
msgid "Huh? You're still in the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF?\nCome on, there's nothing to do there.\nGet your butt back here!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "574076"
msgid "We'll talk about what comes next tomorrow,\nso #C000246204come back and get some rest#CDEF.\nAfter, drop by the Student Council Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "574208"
msgid "We're in a race against time.\nWe need to hurry to the #C000246204Moon Cell's Core#CDEF――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "574300"
msgid "I can't let #C236196003Shinji#CDEF's hopes go to waste.\nLet's press on so we can catch up to #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "574424"
msgid "Praetor, I've grown tired. Let us return\nto My Room and have ourselves a bath."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "574504"
msgid "I know how you feel, but knowing\nwhen to rest is also part of the battle.\nLet's head back to My Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "574608"
msgid "Darling, now is the time for rest.\nLet's return to our room and\nrecover our strength."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "574696"
msgid "What an impatient #[man][woman]#. Laboring away\nis not all there is to life, you know?\nWhen it's time to rest, rest."
msgstr ""

#. unk_op1650
msgctxt "574816"
msgid "You may now save your current game data\n            as #C000246204Clear Data#CDEF."
msgstr "Agora você pode salvar seus dados\n         como #C000246204Clear Data#CDEF."

#. unk_op1650
msgctxt "574900"
msgid "     You may use this data to carry\nover elements to the start of a new game."
msgstr "     Você pode usar esses dados para levar\nelementos ao início de um novo jogo."

#. unk_op1650
msgctxt "574980"
msgid "Please be careful to not overwrite\n  the data while you are saving."
msgstr "Tome cuidado para não sobrescrever\n  os dados ao salvar."

#. unk_op1653
msgctxt "575048"
msgid "Would you like to save your Clear Data?"
msgstr "Deseja salvar seus Clear Data?"

#. popupSaveBeforeQuit_line1
msgctxt "575088"
msgid "Are you sure you wish to exit"
msgstr "Tem certeza de que deseja sair"

#. popupSaveBeforeQuit_line2
msgctxt "575120"
msgid "without saving the Clear Data?"
msgstr "sem salvar os Clear Data?"

#. popupStd
msgctxt "575152"
msgid "Continue to the next floor?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "575180"
msgid "Continue to the next floor."
msgstr ""

#. popupStd
msgctxt "575208"
msgid "Return to the previous floor?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "575240"
msgid "Return to previous floor."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "575268"
msgid "Return to the old school."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "575296"
msgid "I was on alert in case she might teleport away,\nbut it seems she can't this time around."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "575388"
msgid "Y-you've got the wrong person! Wrong person!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "575436"
msgid "I'm actually #C236196003Jinako#CDEF's twin little sister,\nJimeko. Whaddup. Thanks for putting up\nwith #C236196003Jinako#CDEF all this time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "575576"
msgid "…we meet, and she starts trying to\nfool us in a cringeworthy way."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "575644"
msgid "I see, wrong person, huh?\nOkay, I believe you.\nWell then, that's that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "575716"
msgid "It matters not to me whether you're her little\nsister, older sister, or cousin. I'm making\nSOMEONE with her face take responsibility."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "575852"
msgid "Hrm, we're in a pickle now, Darling. This\nexcuse is so poor that it makes me want to\nstart asking a few more questions."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "575972"
msgid "Hmph. Let's get one thing straight, \"Jimeko.\"\nNeither the mongrel or I recall ever putting\nup with #C236196003Jinako#CDEF even once."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "576108"
msgid "―――Ah, not buying it, huh!\nOh, well… The truth is that I was forced\nto say all this, and it's even a pain for me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "576228"
msgid "S-sure, those signs are #C236196003Jinako#CDEF #ROFS0002#RUBS  productions#RUBEhandicrafts#REND,\nbut never in a million years\ndid I expect them to annoy you―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "576392"
msgid "It was an honest oopsies,\nI didn't have the slightest bad intention."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "576464"
msgid "My head is starting to hurt more and more."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "576508"
msgid "But if we can settle things without fighting,\nI agree, that would be the best outcome……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "576600"
msgid "So you get me, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF? Man, you've been\nbarking up the wrong gal. So now if you\ncould just reel in that sketch Servant."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "576736"
msgid "Among all the #C236196003Jinako#CDEF, I'm the most popular\nand have #RUBS relatively#RUBEa very#REND social disposition, see?\nThat's how it is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "576880"
msgid "And besides, #C236196003Jinako#CDEF ain't got the slightest\nclue what an \"#C000246204SG#CDEF\" is. Is it like, spicy? Can't\ngive you something without knowin' what it is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "577052"
msgid "I think it's something that's too\nmuch to be asking for."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "577112"
msgid "#C236196003Jinako#CDEF, frightened, shrinks back."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "577164"
msgid "―――And at the same time,\nher \"lance\" makes his appearance.\nThe sense of who was in control completely shifts."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "577280"
msgid "I sense #C236196003#SVT#CDEF get defensive,\nand nervously #SVT[snap up straight][stir as if gulping a dry throat][lift her ears and tail straight up][add in non-existent dialog]#."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "577460"
msgid "His feet are positioned half a step more ahead than usual,\nand his unaffectedly hanging fingertips are faintly exerted."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "577580"
msgid "I―――might be interpreting this wrong,\nbut he seems to have made motions toward\nprotecting his Master, #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "577720"
msgid "Those words deviate from how you\ntruly feel, Master."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "577776"
msgid "They paid to challenge this Labyrinth, in the\nsum of fair danger and the time they have left.\nThere's no reason for them to just turn back."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "577916"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF―――Sorry about this.\nIn place of my pathetic Master, I apologize for\nthis blunder, this accident."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "578048"
msgid "Saying that, #C236196003Lancer#CDEF gently closes his eyes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "578108"
msgid "He had a purely dazzling, straight attitude for\none who was baptized clean of the many pesky signs we faced."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "578220"
msgid "Also, #C236196003Jinako Carigiri#CDEF's messy room and this\nmerely-spacious Labyrinth aren't so different―\nThey consist of pointless size and fat."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "578368"
msgid "Finding something here is like pulling out\nunworn underwear from a pile of laundry―\na dreadful penance. I can sympathize."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "578492"
msgid "A-all you've been doing is saying\nwhatever you want! Whose side are you on!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "578572"
msgid "Bodily speaking, I'm on your side."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "578608"
msgid "Oooh, I was hoping you would say\n\"emotionally\" on my side!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "578668"
msgid "F-fine! Show me how a minor, Mahabarata or\nYogacurry or whatever Heroic Spirit like you\ncan be worth a single damn!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "578784"
msgid "I shall do so if you command.\nOur guests won't leave so readily.\nAt the very least, have a taste of my lance."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "578896"
msgid "Goosebumps tingle over my skin.\nIn contrast to his gentle, closing remark, \nhe swells in that instant with fighting spirit."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "579020"
msgid "Take an extra step back than you usually do,\nMaster. It doesn't seem like I'll get any\nchances to look behind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "579132"
msgid "This guy is trouble, Darling!\nHe definitely doesn't know what the\nwords \"hold back\" mean!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "579224"
msgid "Hmph. Brave words. If such a feast suits my\npalate, then I'll partake. Don't barrage us with\nNoble Phantasms, or I'll cut you both down."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "579364"
msgid "He shoots laser beams from his eyes―――\nYeah, my Servant is a special type!\nA laser beam Heroic Spirit: a #C000246204Launcher#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "579500"
msgid "…#C236196003Lancer#CDEF, are you alright with that?\nYour expression says you don't mind.\n…I see, a #C000246204Launcher#CDEF, huh…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "579636"
msgid "*kgh*, what horrible taste…!\nThough it's not necessarily wrong,\nit ticks me off even more…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "579732"
msgid "………I have no choice. Such is my fate for\nhaving a Master of unique inclinations.\nI don't mind being a #C000246204Launcher#CDEF from now on."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "579876"
msgid "Look how understanding he is! And how he\nputs on airs by not dealing the final blow.\nHe's the #ROFS0002#RUBS   slack#RUBEhandicap#REND a skilled person gives!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "580036"
msgid "I had no intention on going easy.\nThey're not opponents that would go\ndown very quickly."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "580128"
msgid "In showing my Master the capability of\nour opponents, all I did was conclude that we\nmust take a second look at our approach."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "580256"
msgid "I had forgotten what it was like to\nfight a real Heroic Spirit\nsince coming to the #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "580380"
msgid "Acting all #RUBS      lenient  #RUBEhigh and mighty#REND, not even\nsmirking at them―what's up with you?\nYour heart made outta sponge?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "580516"
msgid "I don't mind. Even if the aquarium's manatee\nturns into an earless seal, #C236196003BB#CDEF won't care."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "580620"
msgid "More importantly―――Your true nature has\nstarted showing an awful lot,\nfor a while now. Is that alright, Master?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "580736"
msgid "A pain stabs at my left arm, intermittently―――\nthe sign of an #C000246204SG#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "580824"
msgid "It's clearly reacting to #C236196003Jinako#CDEF and Lanc…\n#C236196003Launcher#CDEF's back and forth.\nThat overwhelming dominance had conversely\nweakened her mental wall."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "580996"
msgid "I can't afford to miss\nthis perfect chance to provoke her―――!"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "581064"
msgid "Jinako hasn't used up a single calorie, huh?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "581112"
msgid "It's a rout… I don't feel we can win anymore."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "581160"
msgid "My b-brain,\nI'm working out my brain!\n#C236196003Karna#CDEF#ROFS0004#RUBS     my errand boy for#RUBE is in charge#REND of my shopping!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "581296"
msgid "Even though this is the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF―no,\nbecause it is―thinking takes a lot of calories.\nDon't make me say it, it's embarrassing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "581444"
msgid "I see… then I didn't even need this elaborate\nsetup in the first place. I should've done\nsomething more simple."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "581560"
msgid "I attack after farming as much experience from\nmid-bosses and mini-bosses as possible, so I got\ncaught up in the grind―a bad habit of mine…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "581704"
msgid "―――That's right. That's a habit of hers.\nEverything on this floor was devised by #C236196003Jinako#CDEF.\nNow I'm starting to get what her #C000246204SG#CDEF is about."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "581876"
msgid "Suddenly they're all obvious lies."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "581912"
msgid "What's she protecting with these lies?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "581952"
msgid "Sorry my lies are so lame!\nA strong person wouldn't understand, anyway.\nDespite what they are, I needed them."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "582064"
msgid "They're just lies.\nWhat's wrong with that?\nThey're useful tools and tactics."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "582144"
msgid "As long as these lies don't end up hurting\neither you or me, then it's fine, isn't it!?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "582232"
msgid "The truth is, you WANTED me to find out."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "582276"
msgid "……wrong!\nI'm telling you, you're WRONG!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "582320"
msgid "#C236196003Jinako Carigiri#CDEF is different.\nThere's definitely something important to her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "582416"
msgid "…what are you saying?\nSomething important to me?\nTo ME?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "582476"
msgid "Huh―? What are you, dumb!?\nThis is why brats like you are such a pain,\nsuch amateurs…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "582568"
msgid "You don't understand anything!\nYou've got nothing to suffer about!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "582636"
msgid "A lie to protect something important?\nOnly blessed winners with the luxury to\ndo so spout such BULLSHIT!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "582744"
msgid "I have nothing that's important to me,\nI have nothing about myself to be proud of!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "582828"
msgid "Having her secret exposed, #C236196003Jinako#CDEF's offshoot vanishes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "582900"
msgid "We finished extracting her #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nNow the Shield will be released."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "582980"
msgid "…but, out of all the #C000246204SGs#CDEF I've extracted so far,\nthis one left the worst aftertaste."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "583084"
msgid "…I confirmed the activation of the next floor.\nAs expected, there seem to be more hidden #C000246204SGs#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "583196"
msgid "#C236196003#NICK#CDEF―――Head on back.\nYou need to get your rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "583264"
msgid "By the way, #C236196003Leo#CDEF, where did #C236196003Gatou#CDEF go?\nIs he on the way back, by any chance?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "583372"
msgid "It seems he had a pretty late start, completely\nfalling for the sign's messages over and over\nand getting stuck."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "583488"
msgid "What?\nI can't tell if he's good at playing along\nwith people or just gullible."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "583568"
msgid "Brother, if you can―after watering the flower\ngarden―can you get a Return Crystal to #C236196003Chief\nGatou#CDEF and tell him the Labyrinth is clear?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "583720"
msgid "I understand, after I tend to the grounds,\nright? …no, I might forget at that point.\nI'll head out now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "583828"
msgid "#C236196003Gatou#CDEF… I wonder if he's alright."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "583880"
msgid "There's one more person who's\nthoroughly adept with people:\n#C236196003Jinako#CDEF's Servant, Lanc―#C236196003Launcher#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "584008"
msgid "Though it naively looks like we managed\nto turn this bad situation around,\nthe fact of the matter is that #C236196003Karna#CDEF's\nconfidence wasn't broken in the slightest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "584184"
msgid "Though the best thing would be if\n#C236196003Jinako#CDEF gave up and started being honest…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "584276"
msgid "Nothing will come out of thinking over this alone.\nLet's start by #C000246204going back to my own room#CDEF."
msgstr ""

